    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wulodi aighu ya kudwalwa wunyika cha Babuloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa kana ghwa kubonya nguma kwake Jehoiakimu mwana wa Josia mzuri wa Juda, (nagho ni mwaka ghwa imbiri ghwa kubonya nguma kwake Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni), BWANA oreghorieghe nani aighu ya wandu wose wa Juda;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Waz. 24.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 36.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.1.1+DAN.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 1.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawighoria wandu wose wa Juda na awo werekoghe wikikaia Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kufuma mwaka ghwa ikumi na idadu ghwa kubonya nguma kwake Josia mwana wa Amoni, mzuri wa Juda, serelekieghe kumghoria ilagho ja BWANA ijo orekoghe ukinighoria, na kuvikia linu ni miaka mirongo iwi na idadu; ela ndemoresikireghe anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndemcheesikira hata kudegha kudu konyu wei msikire, hata ngera BWANA wafungie ndighi kumdumia wadumiki wake walodi ngelo kwa ngelo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikighamba, ‘Ghalukenyi idana, kula umu onyu ufume kwa mighendo yake ya wuwiwi na mabonyo ghake ghizamie, mpate kujikaia isanga ijo BWANA oremnekieghe inyo na weke ndeyo kufuma koicho hata kwa kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msenughe milungu mizima mkiidumikia na kuitasa; mchemvavira BWANA na kuwusira machu ghake kwa iro kazi ra mikonu yenyu. Aho niko nao moni usechaamkaba anduangi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, ‘Ela sena ndemcheenisikira, eri mpate kunivavira na kuwusira machu ghapo kwa wundu ghwa iro kazi ra mikonu yenyu, nenyo mpato ni wasi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo BWANA wa majeshi waghora huwu, angu msenisikire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ola nichaduma malagho kwa mbari rose rikaiagha cha kaskazinyi, na kwa mdumiki wapo Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni, wipate kucha na kulwa na wandu wikaiagha iji isanga; na wandu wose wikaiagha mbai mbai yaro. Nani nichawitotesha putu na kuwibonya kilambo cheobosha kusholelwa, wikaie winonekie kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichawiinjira chwaka ra kuboilwa; lwaka lwa bwana-arusi na bibi-arusi, lwaka lwa magho ghishagha, na mwengere ghwa taa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 7.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.16.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.22+REV.18.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuf. 18.22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isanga jose jichasigharika iduu jimerie kunoneka, na iri mbari ra wandu richamdumikia mzuri wa Babuloni kwa miaka mirongo mfungade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 36.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 29.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 9.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela nyuma ya iyo miaka mirongo mfungade kukatia, nichaikaba mbari ya Babuloni chiaimweri na mzuri waro. Nichajitotesha ijo isanga ja Wakaldayo, kwa wundu ghwa mawiwi ghawo, kujibonya jiwuye iduu kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichaghikatisha malagho ghose nereghighorieghe aighu ya Babuloni, ee, kula ilagho jiandikilo andenyi ya ichi chuo seji Jeremia orefunyireghe wulodi aighu ya mbari rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbari nyingi na wazuri wabaa wichawibonya Wababuloni wikaie wazumba wawo, nani nichawilipa karakara na kazi ra mikonu yawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutanya kwa Mlungu aighu ya iro mbari ra wandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli ukanizera, “Wada ichi kikombe cha divei ya machu ghapo, kuwinyoshe wandu wa iri mbari rose ra wandu nichaakuduma kwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichachinywa na kutatarika, walaghalwa ni akili kwa wundu ghwa wuda nichaaghureda aghadi kwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngachiwada icho kikombe kufuma kwa BWANA, ngawinyosha wandu wa mbari rose awo BWANA unidumie kwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalemu na mizi yose ya Juda na wazuri wawo na wabaa wawo wikanywa; wipate kuwuya wuduu, wa kumenywa, kusekwa na wa kuwasirwa njowe seji koni iko linu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Farao, mzuri wa Misri ukanywa icho kikombe chiaimweri na wadumiki wake, na wabaa wake, na wandu wose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wandu wose wa kighenyi wiko aghadi kwawo, wazuri wose wa isanga ja Uzi na wazuri wose wa isanga ja Wafilisti (Ashkeloni, Gaza, Ekroni, na masighariko gha wandu wa Ashdodi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edomu, Moabu, na wana wa Amoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wazuri wose wa Tiro, wazuri wose wa Sidoni, na wazuri wa masanga gha pwani kimonu cha Bahari ya Mediterania; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dedani, Tema, Buzi, na wandu wose wiaragha virodi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wazuri wose wa Arabu, na wazuri wose wa mbari ra wandu wa mranganyiko werekoghe wikikaia kireti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wazuri wose wa Zimri, wazuri wose wa Elamu, na wazuri wose wa Media; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wazuri wose wa masanga gha kaskazinyi kula na kaavui; na mawuzuri ghose gha wurumwengunyi wiko ndoenyi, wose kwa kunughishirana wikakaia winyo icho kikombe. Na kutua kwa wose, mzuri wa Babuloni uchachinywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
