          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukanizera, “Zera wandu kukaia, Ini BWANA Uwadie Ndighi-Rose, uo Mlungu wa Israeli nawilaghira winyo hata wiwongie na kudaika; wigho hata wisedime kuwuka kwa wundu ghwa ugho wuda nighudumagha kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wikalegha kunywa icho kikombe kufuma mkonunyi kwako kuwizere, BWANA wa majeshi waghamba huwu: ‘Suti mchinyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenyi nazoe kazi eghunona ughu muzi ghuwangilo kwa irina japo. Mwadima kughenda msekabilo? Ndeidimikagha mghende kusekabilo, kwa kukaia nichareda wuda ghuche aighu ya wandu wose wikaiagha ndoenyi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo oho Jeremia, kuchawifunyira wandu awa wulodi ghwa agha malagho ghose nakughoria:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na awo wichaabwaghwa wudenyi ni BWANA ituku ijo, wichaera kula andu ndoenyi. Ndewichaalililwa, angu kutumbanywa, hata kurikwa; ela wichawuya kitungasi ndoenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyo vilongozi, walisha wa wandu wapo, kemenyi kwa lwaka. Lilenyi na kukung'arisha terinyi; ngelo yameria kuvika mpate kubwaghwa, nenyo mchabarwa sa chombo chighokie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walisha ndewichaapata andu kungi kokimbiria, wabaa wa icho chagha ndewichaafufunuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikirenyi kililo cha walisha, na kukema mchungu kwa weke bwana wa icho chagha; kwa kukaia BWANA waawuyanona andu kwawo kolishira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maranu gha sere ghichasaghiswa kwa wundu ghwa agho machu ghibirie gha BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wasighie andu kwake sa shimba isighie mbanga yake, isanga jawo jawurie iduu, kwa wundu ghwa wuda ghwa mkorongi, na kwa wundu ghwa agho machu ghake ghibirie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
